@ Index:    Lander.R47
@ Author:   stuart_fort
@ Source:   https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?f=48&t=4832
@ Version:  1
@ Tested:   jaymos
@ Input:    into X, activate entries with R/S
@ Output:   on screen
@
@ Registers
@ .00   Config
@ .01   Stack
@ 02    Body acceleration (g)
@ 03    Fuel
@ 04    Altitude
@ 05    Velocity
@ 06    Acceleration
@ 07    Safe landing velocity
@ 
@ Variables
@ Body  Body #/Name
@ Burn  Burn rate
@ 
@ Flags
@ none
@ 
@ Labels
@     Save state, Initialize program
@ 01    Set variables for Earth
@ 02    Set variables for Mars
@ 03    Set variables for Luna
@ 04    Set variables for Vesta
@ 10    Initialize descent
@ 20    Display variables & input Burn
@ 30    Calculate burn effect & result
@ 40    Fuel depleted
@ 60    Process landing
@ 61    Safe landing
@ 65    Crash landing
@ 70    Random multiplier
@ 80    Clear screen
@ 90    Output final velocity, restore state


LBL ‘Lander’
  LocR 10
  STOCFG R.00
  STOS R.01
  FIX 01
  5.
  STO R07
  0.
  STO ‘Burn’
  SEED
  1
  STO ‘Body’
  XEQ 80
  ‘Lander’
  PAUSE 10
  ‘Location? (1-4)’
  INPUT ‘Body’
  4
  MIN
  1
  MAX
  XEQ →X
  GTO 10

LBL 01
  9.81
  STO R02
  500.
  XEQ 70
  STO R03
  ‘Earth’
  STO ‘Body’
  RTN

LBL 02
  3.71
  STO R02
  300.
  XEQ 70
  STO R03
  ‘Mars’
  STO ‘Body’
  RTN

LBL 03
  1.62
  STO R02
  200.
  XEQ 70
  STO R03
  ‘Luna’
  STO ‘Body’
  RTN

LBL 04
  0.25
  STO R02
  50.
  XEQ 70
  STO R03
  ‘Vesta’
  STO ‘Body’
  RTN

LBL 10
  XEQ 80
  ‘Safe landing velocity = ’
  RCL+ R07
  PAUSE 30
  1000.
  XEQ 70
  STO R04
  -50.
  XEQ 70
  STO R05
  GTO 20

LBL 20
  XEQ 80
  RCL ‘Body’
  ‘ Altitude = ’
  +
  RCL+ R04
  ‘Velocity = ’
  RCL+ R05
  ‘Fuel = ’
  RCL+ R03
  INPUT ‘Burn’
  𝑥>? R03
    GTO 40
  STO- R03

  LBL 30
    RCL ‘Burn’
    RCL R02
    -
    STO R06
    2.
    ÷
    RCL R04
    +
    RCL R05
    +
    STO R04
    𝑥≤? 0.
      GTO 60
    RCL R06
    STO+ R05
    GTO 20

  LBL 40
    XEQ 80
    ‘Fuel depleted!’
    PAUSE 10
    RCL R03
    STO ‘Burn’
    0.
    STO R03
    GTO 30

  LBL 60
    XEQ 80
    ‘Contact...’
    PAUSE 20
    RCL R05
    |𝑥|
    𝑥≤? R07
      GTO 61
    GTO 65

  LBL 61
    XEQ 80
    ‘Safe Landing!’
    TONE 08
    TONE 09
    GTO 90

  LBL 65
    XEQ 80
    ‘Crash!!’
    TONE 01
    TONE 00
    GTO 90

  LBL 70
    0.9
    1.1
    RANI#
    ×
    RTN

  LBL 80
    ‘ ’
    FILL
    RTN

  LBL 90
    RCL ‘Body’
    ‘Final Velocity = ’
    RCL+ R05
    PAUSE 50
    RCLS R.01
    RCLCFG R.00
  END
.END.
